      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move to Trash (%lld · %@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mettre %lld fichiers à la poubelle (%@) ? Rien n'est supprimé tant que la corbeille n'est pas vidée.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move %lld files to Trash (%@)? Nothing is deleted until the Trash is emptied."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mettre à la poubelle": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move to Trash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Annuler": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cancel"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fusionner tous les doublons ?": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merge all duplicates?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fusionner tout": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Merge All"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Garde la meilleure de chaque groupe (plus haute résolution) et met les %@ autres fichiers à la corbeille — récupérables tant que tu ne vides pas la corbeille. Peut prendre du temps : ça travaille en arrière-plan, tu peux continuer.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps the best of each group (highest resolution) and moves the other %@ files to the Trash — recoverable until you empty the Trash. This may take a while: it works in the background, so you can keep going."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chargement des doublons…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Loading duplicates…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
