    "Étape 4/4 — Enregistrement des groupes": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Step 4/4 — Saving groups"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Recherche des fichiers de même taille et même empreinte rapide — quasi instantané.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Searching for files of the same size and quick fingerprint — nearly instant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chaque groupe candidat est relu en entier pour garantir que ce sont de vraies copies (les grosses vidéos prennent du temps).": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each candidate group is re-read in full to confirm they are true copies (large videos take time)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les photos sont comparées visuellement pour repérer les quasi-doublons : rafales, recompressions, redimensionnements.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Photos are compared visually to spot near-duplicates: bursts, recompressions, resizes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Écriture des groupes en base — quelques secondes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Writing groups to the database — a few seconds."
