    "Autres disques": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other drives"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Chaque disque est reconnu par son identifiant unique : ses statistiques, son tri et sa corbeille restent enregistrés sur l'appareil même quand il est débranché. Tu peux brancher plusieurs disques à tour de rôle sans rien mélanger.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each drive is recognized by its unique identifier: its statistics, sorting and Trash stay saved on the device even when it's unplugged. You can connect several drives in turn without mixing anything up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Noter l'application": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rate the app"
          }
        }
      }
